fi
```

### GitFlow Strategy Framework

Based on the repository's GitFlow implementation, manage the complete release lifecycle:

#### Branch Structure
```
main            # Production-ready code
dev             # Integration branch
feature/*       # New features (from dev)
bugfix/*        # Bug fixes (from dev)
breaking/*      # Breaking changes (from dev)
hotfix/*        # Critical fixes (from main)
rc/vX.Y.Z       # Release candidates (from dev)
```

#### Version Bump Strategy
```
feature/*    → Minor version (1.0.0 → 1.1.0)
breaking/*   → Major version (1.0.0 → 2.0.0)
bugfix/*     → Patch version (1.0.0 → 1.0.1)
hotfix/*     → Patch version (1.0.0 → 1.0.1)
maintenance/*→ Patch version (1.0.0 → 1.0.1)
chore/*      → No version change
```

