## Error Handling and Recovery

### Common Issues and Solutions

**Build Failures**:
```
❌ Build failed during release process.

🔍 **Diagnosis**:
  • Check CI/CD logs: {log_url}
  • Common causes: dependency issues, test failures, lint errors

🔧 **Resolution**:
  • Fix the failing tests or lint issues
  • Update dependencies if needed
  • Commit fixes to RC branch
  • Re-trigger CI/CD pipeline
```

**Deployment Failures**:
```
❌ Deployment failed to {environment}.

🔍 **Diagnosis**:
  • Check deployment logs: {deployment_logs}
  • Verify infrastructure health
  • Check resource availability

🔧 **Resolution**:
  • Review deployment configuration
  • Check for infrastructure issues
  • Verify service dependencies
  • Consider rollback if critical
```

**Health Check Failures**:
```
❌ Health checks failing post-deployment.

🔍 **Diagnosis**:
  • Application not responding
  • Dependencies unavailable
  • Configuration issues

🔧 **Resolution**:
  • Check application logs
  • Verify database connections
  • Check environment variables
  • Initiate rollback if needed
```

